Interval.h:21:* There are many different ways to compare Intervals in the literature. To avoid
Interval.h:22:* mistakes, comparison operators are not introduced. Instead, the user
Interval.h:23:* must specify the type of comparison that wants to make.
Interval.h:24:* 
Interval.h:25:* Similar thing happens with the maximum, which cannot be computed exactly
Interval.h:26:* in a reasonable amount of time. Because of that, different maximum
Interval.h:27:* oprations are included
