SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:19:/**
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:20:* The insertion SGS is introduced and detailed in the following paper:
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:21:* "Schedule generation schemes for job shop problems with fuzziness.
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:22:* JJ Palacios, CR Vela, I González-Rodríguez, J Puente - Proceedings of the
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:23:* Twenty-first European Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 687-692,
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:24:* 2014"
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:25:*
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:26:* In brief, it uses an insertion strategy to find holes in the schedule
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:27:* that can be used to introduce the new task with no possibility of
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:28:* delaying any other.
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:29:*
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:30:* @author hdiaz
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:31:*
SGS_IJSP_Insertion.h:32:*/
